  "detection_floor_preregistered": 0.021,
  "read": "the fusion's raw +0.0218 falls to ~+0.0041 once the measured cross-fit optimism is removed, i.e. below the pre-registered 2-sigma detection floor of +0.021. The fusion is therefore PLAUSIBLE but NOT ESTABLISHED as a deployable gain; settling it requires running the incumbent adapter over the 16,621 disjoint train items (one pointwise pass, ~132K forwards) so the fusion can be fitted off-eval and frozen."
